dsh-purge-go
============

This distribution combines two portions with separate authorship:

1. patches/patches.json -- patch definitions (patterns, replacements, markers)
   Exported from the dsh-purge project.
   Community fork: https://github.com/mikamikasuki/dsh-purge
   Original project: https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge (no longer available)
   Copyright (c) dsh-purge authors. Licensed under the terms of that project.

2. Everything else -- dsh-go adaptation layer
   lib/index.js, patches/purge-patch.mjs, cordis.patch.yml, README.md, packaging.
   Copyright (c) 2026 NANA7MI0. MIT, see LICENSE.

Repository ownership (NANA7MI0) means maintainer of the adaptation layer only.
It does not assert authorship of the patch definitions in patches/patches.json.

The operator prompt text consumed by the plugin ($DSH_HOME/prompt-inject.md) is
supplied by the user at runtime and is not part of this repository.
